---
import Film from './Film.astro';
import SectionHead from './SectionHead.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<section data-reveal-group id="why" class="section-pad scroll-mt-20" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <SectionHead id="why-title" title="The last part of a five-star evening is still run on paper." />
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:col-span-7 lg:pt-3">
        <p class="t-body measure">
          A card torn in half. A radio call. A guest standing in 40-degree heat wondering if anyone wrote down their plate. When something goes wrong, nobody can prove what happened, and the hotel pays.
        </p>
        <p class="t-body measure text-ink-2">
          Valett was built after its founders waited thirty minutes for their car in the Dubai summer and realised the most convenience-focused industry in hospitality had no convenience in it. So we replaced the ticket with a system: a camera at the door, a page on the guest’s phone, and a board the whole operation runs on. Every car is documented before it moves, every guest is a text away, and every minute is on the record.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {site.film.show && <Film variant="full" class="mt-16 w-full md:mt-24" />}
  </div>
</section>
